{"id":"ef982eb252b5d3ed","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-rel-restriction.md","title":"ZFC Rel Restriction","display":"df-zfc-rel-restriction — ZFC Rel Restriction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rel-restriction","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rel-restriction"],"display":"df-zfc-rel-restriction — ZFC Rel Restriction","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rel-restriction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rel-restriction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rel-restriction — ZFC Rel Restriction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"41276343f41b253b\" href=\"?note=41276343f41b253b\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,R,X,A\\in V\">\\(S,R,X,A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelRestriction}_S(S,R,X,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelRestriction}_S(S,R,X,A)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}restriction} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelRestriction}_S(S,R,X,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land S=R\\cap(A\\times X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}restriction} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelRestriction}_S(S,R,X,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land S=R\\cap(A\\times X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is domain restriction: only the first coordinate is restricted to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>. The ambient carrier makes the second-coordinate type explicit and distinguishes it from the induced subrelation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\cap(A\\times A)\">\\(R\\cap(A\\times A)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md","status":"resolved","id":"41276343f41b253b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,R,X,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelRestriction}_S(S,R,X,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}restriction} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelRestriction}_S(S,R,X,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land S=R\\cap(A\\times X)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"R\\cap(A\\times A)","display":false}],"bytes":881,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3320","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-rel-restriction.md|58-df-zfc-rel-restriction]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["41276343f41b253b"]}